<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal to launch French franc bond Thursday.</title>
<headline>Portugal to launch French franc bond Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal will launch a 10-year, fixed-rate eurobond in French francs on Thursday for an amount still to be fixed, the Institute for Public Credit Management (IGCP) said.</p>
</text>
